{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune chaser is an Inventory management auto battler focused on deep character customization and crafting where you build your own character one body-part at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Body Part System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/4c7b21c349483e5891150d4b9b620f19.poster.avif?t=1773517586\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/4c7b21c349483e5891150d4b9b620f19.webm?t=1773517586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/4c7b21c349483e5891150d4b9b620f19.mp4?t=1773517586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is composed of 4 types of body parts: Core, Arms, Visages and Coils.  <br>Each body part archetype comes with unique pool of crafted modifiers.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trifecta Magic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/498d29cdab5db926c616cd1e851991b1.avif?t=1773517586\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras_big/498d29cdab5db926c616cd1e851991b1.avif?t=1773517586 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arms are the main means of dealing damage, they use 3 types of magic: Water, Lightning and Cold.\u00a0 <br>Each magic school has its own set of mechanics and modifiers. They all synergize with each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rune-crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/be2c02e453f316b016b93cbc1237a13a.avif?t=1773517586\" width=912 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes are the main currency of the game, they allow you to shape your body parts however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Rune has it's own unique effect. Finding the right combinations of runes to use on an item is key to victory.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally injected skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/d1cd4e7c9a2582dbfdd200f1113d9e8b.avif?t=1773517586\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras_big/d1cd4e7c9a2582dbfdd200f1113d9e8b.avif?t=1773517586 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you play with a different randomized skill tree. Uncover the fog of war and commit to a path.<br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926720?t=1773517586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/bad0db22984b477c494d1fafa2a874e1d8dcc3c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773517586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/9bb9e450469a6c1dc75a245828291f78b6660360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773517586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/9bb9e450469a6c1dc75a245828291f78b6660360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773517586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features existential and philosophical themes. It also features a fair bit of corpses and decay, although not for shock value but for narrative meaning. It's similar to how Dark Souls handles those types of elements."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune chaser is an Inventory management auto battler focused on deep character customization and crafting where you build your own character one body-part at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Body Part System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/4c7b21c349483e5891150d4b9b620f19.poster.avif?t=1773517586\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/4c7b21c349483e5891150d4b9b620f19.webm?t=1773517586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/4c7b21c349483e5891150d4b9b620f19.mp4?t=1773517586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is composed of 4 types of body parts: Core, Arms, Visages and Coils.  <br>Each body part archetype comes with unique pool of crafted modifiers.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trifecta Magic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/498d29cdab5db926c616cd1e851991b1.avif?t=1773517586\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras_big/498d29cdab5db926c616cd1e851991b1.avif?t=1773517586 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arms are the main means of dealing damage, they use 3 types of magic: Water, Lightning and Cold.\u00a0 <br>Each magic school has its own set of mechanics and modifiers. They all synergize with each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rune-crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/be2c02e453f316b016b93cbc1237a13a.avif?t=1773517586\" width=912 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes are the main currency of the game, they allow you to shape your body parts however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Rune has it's own unique effect. Finding the right combinations of runes to use on an item is key to victory.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally injected skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/d1cd4e7c9a2582dbfdd200f1113d9e8b.avif?t=1773517586\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras_big/d1cd4e7c9a2582dbfdd200f1113d9e8b.avif?t=1773517586 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you play with a different randomized skill tree. Uncover the fog of war and commit to a path.<br> </p>","developers":["theRunecrafter"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/11f0e2dcd55a0a5081feb925ffde926d42d39013/header.jpg?t=1773517586","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926720/35966464/2501b3f403141d3eae5ee4f8ea1c76a951a9b882/1769677000/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769677273","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926720/35966464/2501b3f403141d3eae5ee4f8ea1c76a951a9b882/1769677000/d